
[FNS-BEGIN]
STORE-LOG
MINT-ERROR         58 LOG() : Zero or negative.
X **********
STORE-SQRT
MINT-ERROR         61 SQRT() : Negative.
X ********
STORE-INF
MINT-ERROR         58 LOG() : Zero or negative.
X *******
PASS-LOG
MINT-ERROR         58 LOG() : Zero or negative.
P **********
PASS-SQRT
MINT-ERROR         61 SQRT() : Negative.
P ********
PASS-INF
MINT-ERROR         58 LOG() : Zero or negative.
P *******
[FNS-END]